   "heading": "ألبوم جو",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "reading",
     "star": true,
     "title": "My Holiday Album",
     "paragraphs": [
      "My name is Joe and I love travelling. These are some of my favourite holiday photos.",
      "Last year, my family and I visited Libya. We went to Leptis Magna. It was a great Roman city, and you can still see the theatre and the old market today. It was amazing!",
      "Two years ago, we went to Egypt and saw the pyramids. People built them thousands of years ago. There are more than one hundred pyramids in Egypt!",
      "In London, I took a photo of Big Ben. Many people think Big Ben is the clock, but it is the name of the big bell inside the tower. That was interesting!",
      "In Italy, we saw the Leaning Tower of Pisa. The ground under it is too soft, so the tower leans. It was fantastic!",
      "The most exciting place was Victoria Falls in Zimbabwe. The water falls more than one hundred metres, and it is very loud!",
      "Last summer, we walked in Park Güell in Barcelona. There are beautiful buildings and colourful mosaics there."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "lead": "جو يحب السفر، وهذه بعض صور عطلاته. اضغط «اقرأ لي النص» وتابع الجمل المضيئة، أو اضغط على أي جملة لتسمعها وحدها."
  },
